Files trackXXX.csv and free_drift2.csv: 

1: Absolute time
2: Frame number
3: Number of points detected in the next columns (joints detected by the camera)
4-..: id1,x1,y1, id2,x1,y2,.... id is the identifier (1-100 for for the 1st camera, 100-200 for the 2nd camera)


Files dataXXX.csv and free_drift2.csv: 
1: Relative time
2-7: setpoints of the joints
8-13: actual motor axis positions
